#: scenario3:scenario3_5F65D0CB_3C76_499E_AD53_CAB8E35B41DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cb0eb41b525ad7d25d391b7434e8a4bbf43daa57c80f122c72cf492f85e7528
