msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When did you get perfume?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And I have to say, you seem to be having ⟪k:4⟫"
"quite⟪k:5⟫ the time.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Look at you—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫you’re out of breath! Red as a beet!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Da quand’è che ti metti il profumo?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hmf... ⟪k:4⟫sembra che tu stia "
"trascorrendo una ⟪k:5⟫bella serata⟪k:6⟫.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Guardati—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫sei senza fiato! Sei rossa "
"come un peperone!"

