#: scenario3:scenario3_0E06B623_797B_4A2C_A1AB_25AC1EADBEE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 114e66118b00bc2ce40de402f1d698335c7c1f4bff7864d9ffbb317b173d3e6c
