"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I have told you before you are ⟪k:2⟫not⟪k:3⟫ to leave this house without first "
"consulting me! ⟪k:4⟫Or do you mean to tell me you’ve forgotten?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ti ho già detto che non esci di casa⟪k:2⟫senza esserti prima consultata con me!⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫O vorresti forse dirmi che te ne sei scordata?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BDEE98E1_A681_4ADE_8459_143BF942CBA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36a426206080de57957a4fa35fe225ae98d6a348510b56a562d44cd967b17df5
