#: scenario3:scenario3_38AE51B4_B6ED_4722_A12E_51DA35244AA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e97c614c8e7c56558831c75ef6513aa201bbf6ddb70aa8ab72e8a026a1466e8
