msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Silence! I have no interest in your excuses!⟪k:2⟫You’re always watching from the "
"shadows,⟪k:3⟫observing, trying not to step on anyone’s toes..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Silenzio! Non mi interessano le tue scuse!⟪k:2⟫Te ne stai sempre lì, nascosta "
"nell’ombra ad osservare,⟪k:3⟫cercando di non metterti tra i piedi..."

