msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫These things happen, y’know?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s not easy being married—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫in a lot of "
"ways."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Queste cose succedono, sai?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non è facile essere sposati—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫per tanti "
