"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’ll dunk his head in cold water until he’s not blowing steam from his ears anymore!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Immergerò la sua testa nell’acqua fredda finché il vapore non smetterà di uscirgli "
