msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ll cool him down, promise.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And you never know, maybe he’ll be open to listening."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You could be back to the way you were a year ago in no time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lo calmo io, te lo prometto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E chi lo sa, magari sarà disposto ad ascoltarmi.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫Potreste tornare a come eravate un anno fa in un battibaleno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_17D19490_E48C_4C87_8798_185CF9385F70
