msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Don’t you worry. I’ll take care of it, Madam.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Be positive. You look so much "
"better with a smile on your face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Stai tranquilla. Me ne occupo io, Madam.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sii ottimista. Sei così bella quando "
"sorridi."

