#: scenario3:scenario3_ED66B8D9_83CC_4613_99DE_1C26A61D6556
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59656e9333671ea1d59b568e81af6d535a8117472c63cb6cc50a0065a6868b66
