msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, she grabbed onto that sliver of hope. ⟪k:1⟫She let herself dream."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, la giovane si aggrappò a quel barlume di speranza.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Continuò a sognare."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6E5C335F_D91B_4607_B512_AAB5DB290F60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abb862b9cf75aa76c897e6df9641ec74f33d1c981884f2364cdf52769794ea57
