msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D5702339_7FA3_49CF_A15F_54975F8CFDF8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That night, she did not sleep."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quella notte, lei non dormì."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C2DA9AE4_5513_4278_A561_3EA79D660122
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7316ceba4a1994e7db132a29ca1004c61bc2e07c1e862848d652890aa507f873
#. default-sha256: 895d11665c91d6c5354f6678debdcf2a9fda67a157c76853ecd21c5e61dde410
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C2DA9AE4_5513_4278_A561_3EA79D660122"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was afraid that even in her dreams,⟪k:1⟫Jacopo would be shouting at her.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She "
"felt as though her memories of a year prior⟪k:4⟫were beginning to crumble away..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva paura che anche nei suoi sogni, Jacopo le avrebbe urlato contro.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sentiva come "
"se i ricordi dell’anno passato stessero iniziando a sgretolarsi..."
